	{
		{"msgoff"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat060140"},
		line=1397,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Illuminated by the last, dying rays of the setting sun, a lone figure passes through the gates of the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The Artifact she wears is covered with scratches, but her footfalls are firm and steady.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I rush forward and embrace her with all my might.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone, don't jump on me like that. It's embarrassing.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"She murmurs, holding me back at arm's length.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But, but, I am just so glad that you are safe!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're hardly one to talk.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm glad you made it out all right, too.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Akari peers into my face with a smile.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Yet her smile is somehow strangely distant.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“U-Um... Where might Soujin-sama be?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He set off to a new battlefield in order to protect us.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's over now. All of it.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“What happened to Onii-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Was he not fighting alongside you?!”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, you must tell me!”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Even as Kanami-sama grabs her by the shoulders and shakes her, Akari-sama stares resolutely forward.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kanami!”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Hotori-sama seizes Kanami-sama by her arms.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin is a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He did what he had to... Don't you understand?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't grieve... Be proud...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“...I understand. I am a daughter of Tokita, after all...”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Seeing Kanami-sama biting her trembling lip, Akari-sama cannot help but lower her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-san, what about Rochel?”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He is no longer of this world.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I see...”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“May God rest you, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Elsa-sama whispers, drawing a cross in front of her chest.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"I already had the premonition that Soujin-sama would not be returning.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"As soon as Kuronushi-no-Ookami withdrew, I stopped being able to sense Soujin-sama and Kahaku as well.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"But hearing it put into words nonetheless wrenches my heart.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"─How I loved those big, warm hands of yours that would always stroke my head a bit too roughly.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"─How I loved your awkward, troubled smile.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"─Oh, how I yearned for you, Soujin-sama.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Looking up at the twilit sky, I try to hold back my overflowing tears.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Elsa, what are the city's damages?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I have no idea. We can't even begin to assess them.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you mean? What happened to the Army?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Completely wasted.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That supernatural light melted every last one of our weapons.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Look, all that's left of my gun.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Elsa-sama holds up a warped piece of metal that looks like it was tossed into a furnace.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"How terrible Kuronushi-no-Ookami's power is.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Though perhaps this is but a trifling retribution for having defied a god.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"At the very least, their lives were spared.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Our casualties aren't that bad, but without our weapons,\nwe're completely helpless.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You won't find a single person in all the Republic with the guts to fight a warrior barehanded.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then we'll need someone to maintain the peace.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's no telling what people might do amid all the chaos.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"My thoughts had been so occupied with Kuronushi-no-Ookami that I did not even consider the dire state of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Someone needs to take the lead and restore order.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The only armed forces available to us right now are the Imperial Police.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kanami, summon them as Empress Hisui and get started with restoring order.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Elsa, Operation Bellflower is still ongoing, right?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Why, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In that case, I'm counting on you to represent the Republican Army and sign a ceasefire with Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Make sure your men don't do anything rash.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You got it.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou, rally your warriors and be ready to respond at a\nmoment's notice.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stay on your toes, just in case the Republican Army decides to try anything.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Also, assign a security detail to guard Empress Hisui's person.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Akari-sama rattles off one order after another.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Um, what would you ask of us?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Put the people at ease as the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“See to it that the dead are given a fitting memorial service.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“As you wish.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"I bow alongside Isuzu, who just barely managed to escape Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We've got a lot of work ahead of us.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Akari turns to regard Tenkyo, dyed in the hue of the setting sun.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"─A new age is upon us.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Such a feeling bubbles up within my heart.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"We are greeted by Shino-sama and an entire retinue of cameramen as we arrive at the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well, well, well, if it isn't our national heroes, making their triumphant return!”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What's the big idea, busting out all these cameras?”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm here to bring your voices to every living room across the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And by the way, today's grand spectacle is already making headlines all across the world.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Shino, what are you plotting?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You'll see, you'll see.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It might be a bit of a bitter pill for the Republic to swallow, though.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well, I think I can hazard a guess.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Besides, I suppose it's my own fault for giving you so much freedom.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Elsa-sama lets out a resigned sigh.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Right, then... lights, camera, action! Get us a nice shot of our heroes!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Here we have Empress Hisui and the warriors who joined hands with the Republican Army to save Tenkyo from destruction!”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"M-Me, a hero? All I did was cause trouble, if anything...",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Just as I feel like hiding my face, Kanami-sama steps forward.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I believe that everyone has already seen images of the tragedy that befell Tenkyo today.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"With the solemn countenance of an Empress, Kanami-sama proclaims an end to the disturbance.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Then, without a moment's delay, she begins talking about ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"that.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"That,",
{"/font"},
" of course, being Akari-sama's lineage.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Ordinarily, the people might have found any number of excuses to dismiss Kanami-sama's declaration.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"But today is different.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"The scenes of Tenkyo's devastation, and the images of its savior, Akari-sama, are being broadcast all across the Empire courtesy of Shino-sama.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Lending irrefutable credence to Kanami-sama's claims.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"As Kanami-sama lowers her head to the ground in a gesture of fealty to Akari-sama, the streets erupt with raucous cheers─",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Cheers celebrating the accession of a new Empress.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"Elsa-sama, acting as the vice governor-general, immediately proceeds to grant the Empire full independence and propose a lasting peace with Akari-sama.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"With all of its weapons melted away by\nKuronushi-no-Ookami's divine power, the Republican Army no longer has any means to sustain its occupation.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Akari-sama does not hesitate in accepting Elsa-sama's proposal, taking her hand in a show of reconciliation.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"If they failed to make treaty here and now, there would be no guarantee that the embittered populace would not seek out requital against the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Akari-sama surely does not wish to see any more blood spilled.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"The cheers raised all across Tenkyo are carried along by the wind.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"All the citizens of the Empire are surely riveted to their television screens, watching the momentous occasion unfolding before them.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"After nearly four long years, the war with the Republic has finally been brought to a peaceful conclusion.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"The thought that I am bearing witness to a scene that will be etched in the annals of history honors me beyond words.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Before I know it, tears are streaming down my cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Though I wipe away at them, they continue to flow without end.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Oh dear...",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Looking around in embarrassment, I finally notice that I am not the only one so deeply touched.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"The eyes of everyone present shine with glistening tears, moved with emotion at the prospect of peace at last.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Everyone... save for Akari-sama.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Early spring, Tenkyo─",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"The clear, blue sky is aburst with fireworks commemorating the opening of the Independence Day celebration.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Just over two months have passed since the great disturbance in Tenkyo, and the city has returned to peace and tranquility.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Akari-sama's first order of business upon acceding to the Imperial Throne was to restore public order.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"She reformed the Imperial Police and Okonogi's former Forbidden Guard into a new organization in order to quell any unrest between Republican soldiers and the Imperial people.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"At the same time, she arranged for the repatriation of the Republican Army, the second wave of which just departed a few days ago.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"As for Kanami-sama, she was recognized for her meritorious service to the Empire and absolved of all her crimes.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"That alone was already an extraordinary act of clemency, but it was additionally decided that Empress Hisui's name would be officially recorded in the Imperial genealogy.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Doing so was an unprecedented gesture for the Imperial Family, which esteems its bloodline above all, but I wholeheartedly approved of it.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Though there are none who doubt Akari-sama's lineage, there still remain many citizens who revere Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Surely, the sentiments of the people were taken into account.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"I shall never forget the look on Kanami-sama's face when she first heard the news.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"As for Hotori-sama and the rest of the warriors, they were all granted positions within the palace as Akari-sama's Imperial Guard.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Theirs is a position of great honor, serving as the\nEmpress's personal bodyguards.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"With the Republican Army having lost all its weapons, there are none who are capable of standing against the warriors anymore.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"It pleases me to know that Akari-sama can now finally sleep easy.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Akari-sama has also made efforts to begin restoring the former Warrior District, which had been abandoned ever since the war.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"We priestesses did all we could to gather the sun-bleached remains of the fallen warriors and grant them a worthy memorial service.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"From what I understand, a public park and war memorial are to be built atop the charred ruins of the Warrior District.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"I daresay that within five years' time, it will be a positively lovely spot to view the peach blossoms in full bloom.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"I am already looking forward to picnicking there with everyone.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Speaking of restoration efforts, Akari-sama spared no expense in ensuring that the Imperial Temple was promptly rebuilt.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Thanks to her benevolence, we of the priesthood are again able to spend each and every day listening to the people's concerns and offering them our prayers.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Though the war may be over, the people's worries are never ending, and our work is never done.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"In spite of that, however, I shall always do my utmost to ensure that all the people may be blessed with sound hearts.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Making this decision of my own accord, I saw to it that a shrine venerating Kuronushi-no-Ookami was built in a corner of the refurbished Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"I plan to leave it in the care of Sekka-san in the near future.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
{"font", size=47},
"As the newly-appointed Republican governor-general, Elsa-sama also serves as the Republic's ambassador to the Empire, working day and night to establish friendly relations between our two countries.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Incidentally, fresh bellflowers seem to have become a permanent fixture decorating Elsa-sama's office.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"I believe the manager is to thank for that.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"The politics of the world have also undergone a seismic shift in the past two months.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Taking inspiration from the Empire's independence, anti-Republican sentiment has gained momentum the world over.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Elsa-sama indicated that in the near future, the Republic intends to curtail its expansionism and withdraw its forces from across the globe.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"This sudden shift in policy seems to be related in no small part to Kahaku's disappearance.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"I can only hope that this reversal will lead to more equitable power relations and an end to armed conflict.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
{"font", size=47},
"It is said that the images of the Republican Army's downfall in Tenkyo, broadcast worldwide in real time, granted courage to all those downtrodden peoples living under the thumb of the Republic.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Hence, there are whispers among certain circles that Shino-sama played an instrumental role in the collapse of the Republic's hegemony.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Incidentally, not one of the broadcasts contained any depictions of Kuronushi-no-Ookami or the Empire's magicks.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"A certain great statesman once said, “The wealth of the world is finite, and there can be no peace unless we all share in it equally.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Upon hearing that, however, I could not help but think─",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Perhaps what is truly needed is not the kindness to share in plenty, but the willingness to share in a little hunger.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Though as someone who always loves to eat my fill, I can only pray that Oomikami will grant me the strength to do so...",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Greeted by thunderous applause, Akari-sama, the eighty-eighth Empress─",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Empre",
{"ruby", text="Peach Blossom"},
"ss Touka, st",
{"/ruby"},
"ands before her people.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"The faces of all those present are decorated with joyful smiles.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Not expressions impelled at gunpoint by the Republican Army, but true, sincere sentiments from the heart.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"As Her Majesty's faithful Exalt-Priestess, my place is right here, watching over her gallant figure from behind.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“At the Armistice Day ceremony last year, I intended to meet my end upon this stage after striking down Okonogi Tokihiko.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Powerless as I was to defeat the Republican Army, I sought to at least take vengeance upon the traitor who betrayed his own country.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How foolish I was to even consider raising my blade against the devoted retainer who sacrificed his everything to protect the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Akari-sama directs a rueful smile at the crowd.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It has been a full year since that day, and it pleases me beyond words to be able to stand here before you now.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My joy comes not from having been made Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But from seeing the Empire achieve its independence, and from sharing in the joys of its people.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Akari-sama meets the swell of applause with a brilliant smile.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Empress Hisui's smile had the power to inspire kindness, but Empress Touka's smile has the power to inspire hope.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Just seeing it grants me the courage to believe that tomorrow will be even brighter than today.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"The Empire stands at a crossroads, and it will need an Empress like Akari-sama.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Henceforth, the Empire will surely need to undergo a great transformation in accordance with the demands of the new age.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But I have faith that we are all of one mind in yearning for a brighter tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Few things require more courage than embracing change.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“However, that bright future will never come about unless we are willing to accept reform.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Know that I will always be with you.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let us share in our joys and sorrows together as we forge a new Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Akari-sama warmly narrows her eyes as she is met with uproarious applause and cheers.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Her gentle smile conveys her love for the people louder than any words.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Yet her dignified demeanor cannot help but remind me of the tragic determination with which she faced the battlefields of the past.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Akari-sama has lost many things to get to where she is now.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Her family, her friends, her comrades... and Soujin-sama.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"At the same time, she has claimed countless lives by her own hand.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"It is only because she has known sorrow and grief beyond measure that she can be this compassionate, this strong.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Akari-sama─Empress Touka─will surely be a benevolent ruler whose name will be remembered for ages more.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"The august sight of her, still waving graciously to the people, only serves to strengthen my faith.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"After the nearly three-hour-long ceremony, I escort Akari-sama back to the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks for keeping me company.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Akari-sama slumps into her throne with a deep sigh.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"It is an exhalation bespeaking the depth of the fatigue seeping through her body.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“(She must be exhausted.)”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Ever since her enthronement, Akari-sama has devoted her every waking moment to the governance of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"I have heard that she takes at most three hours of sleep each day.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Perhaps it is impertinent for me to think this, but Akari-sama has thrown herself into her work like a woman possessed.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"She always feels somewhat distant, and it has been a long time since I last saw her genuinely smile.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Perhaps the black snow that fell on Tenkyo that day has yet to melt inside Akari-sama's heart.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Shall I prepare some tea?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm? Ah, sorry. I was just lost in thought.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Akari-sama rises from her throne.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Perhaps you ought to get some rest.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm fine. Don't worry about me.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ooh... As you say.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"I know that nothing I say will move her.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"As I sink into helpless silence, a cheery melody drifts in on a breeze laden with the fragrance of budding blossoms.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The city is reveling in the Persica Blossom Festival.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I daresay the festival this year is more impressive than any I have ever seen.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's definitely reason to rejoice.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Akari-sama casts her gaze outside.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Do you remember how we spent the festival last year working at Koujiya Flowers?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That takes me back.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Have you been to the shop since?”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haven't had the chance.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've also been meaning to poke my head in at Miyoshi.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You may be pleased to know that it continues to serve as a favorite hangout for the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's nice. I've been really craving Sarashina's food, too.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"A faint smile drifting across her lips, Akari-sama returns her gaze to the darkness of the palace.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"As though avoiding the dazzling light of the outside.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Anyway, Kotone, I should be getting back to my work.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"She is kicking me out.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In that case, I shall be taking my leave.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If I may be permitted to say so, you conducted yourself most splendidly at the Independence Day memorial, Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hopefully things in Tenkyo will start to settle down a little.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"Akari-sama turns her attention to the mountain of paperwork stacked at her side.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"Her face is hard and grim.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Wholly different from the beaming expression she showed the people just a few hours ago.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Akari-sama raises a hand to her mouth.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(No way...)”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"I try to approach her, but Akari-sama holds me back with a wave of her hand.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm fine. Nothing to worry about.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But...”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“When I say I'm fine, it means I'm fine. Really.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“R-Right...”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"As Akari-sama turns around, the dim light casts noticeable shadows on her hollow cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"It is undeniable that her exhausting work is wearing her down.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"But even more than that, an undispellable darkness seems to loom over her.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please, do take good care of yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"All alone, I depart the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"The Persica Blossom Festival is in full swing in the city.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Feasts are being held on every street corner, and lively melodies drift across the throngs of revelers.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Illuminated by the warm light of the streetlamps, the Persica take on an enchanted hue, enthralling all the city with their beauty.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now this is peace.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"Seeing nothing but smiles everywhere I look, my own lips curve inexplicably upwards.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"It makes me happy to see proof that my reign as Empress Touka hasn't been too disappointing.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"But at the same time, it feels as though I've somehow wandered into another world.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"A world filled with foreign language and music, filled with dancing and drinking and laughter and revelry─",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"It all feels so distant to me.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Like a solitary black stone amidst an ocean of white sand, just being here makes me vaguely uncomfortable.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"Not sure what I even came here looking for, I aimlessly wander the bustling streets.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Eventually, my feet carry me to the Imperial Tomb.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"I look down from the viewing platform at the nightscape below.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"The bright lights of the festival blot out the darkness, and the haze of the Persica drifts dreamily across the city.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"─I've seen this in my dreams.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"This is the Tenkyo nightscape I've been waiting so long to finally see.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isn't it beautiful?”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"I murmur to the person standing beside me.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"......",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"There's nobody there.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nobody?”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"Only when I whisper that do I finally realize─",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"Oh... All this time, I was looking for ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"him.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"I wandered all across Tenkyo looking for the lingering traces of his presence.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"Even though... Even though he is no longer of this world.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"As soon as his name escapes my lips, the dam around my heart bursts.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"All the emotions I'd sealed away gush out all at once.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"Recollections of his smile, his kindness, his warmth race through my body, leaving me incapable of thinking of anything else.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"I knew this would happen.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"I knew I'd be completely helpless to pull myself together.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"That's why, until the state of affairs in the Empire settled down, I forbade myself from ever thinking about him, from ever remembering him.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"─But it's okay now, isn't it?",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"─It's okay for me to call out your name and drown myself in your memories, isn't it?",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"I mean, just look how beautiful Tenkyo is tonight.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"The people feast and drink, sing and dance, rejoicing in the peace of today and tomorrow.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"Look, Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"This is the vista you created.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			{
"This vista you protected in exchange for your life.",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"I wanted to look at it together with you, in this place, on this day─",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			{
"This most beautiful vista in all the world.",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"Oh, Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"I want to see you.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"I want you to tell me I'm doing a good job, that it's all gonna be okay.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"I want you to take me into your strong arms, and I want to fill my lungs up with your scent.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"Hey... Soujin?",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"Why am I all alone?",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"Tell me why...",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Why did you have to leave me?",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"Why did you have to disappear and leave me behind?",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...I miss you.”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"The heat and pressure begin to build up behind my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"I promised I wouldn't cry, but it's okay now, isn't it?",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"Ever since you disappeared, I've been holding it back, but\nit's all right now, isn't it?",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"I don't need to worry about anyone around me.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"After all, I'm all alone here.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"In all the world...",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			{
"In this whole wide world, I'm all...",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"Alone─",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“──────────!”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			{
"They scatter...",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"Fluttering from the sky.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			{
"One petal of Persica, and another.",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			{
"The falling petals rapidly multiply, coalescing into a whirlwind that envelops the night.",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			{
"Until, at last, the snowdrops of Persica descend upon the twilit city.",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"Hotori looks up from her work tidying up the shop.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"Flower petals flutter down softly on her dark hair and outstretched palms.",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kanami! Look at all these peach petals!”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Are they scattering already? That is awfully early, considering how warm it's been this year.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No... there's way too many.”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's practically snowing peach petals.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Huh...?”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"Kanami comes to the storefront and stares in amazement.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"Just like Hotori said, a thick snow of petals is falling all across Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"The people rush out into the streets to witness this miracle born in the night of spring.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“To witness a sight as beautiful as this, perhaps it was worth it to have survived for this long.”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Indeed, it feels as though I am dreaming.”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			{
"All the city looks up at the sky with wonderous sighs on their lips.",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"Some claim that the Persica themselves are rejoicing in Empress Touka's accession to the throne─",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			{
"Others whisper that they are a gift from Oomikami in celebration of the Empire's independence─",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I wish Soujin could've seen this.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am sure that he is watching, wherever he is.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“My, how delightfully elegant.”",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			{
"Mutsumi opens the window, gazing out at the picturesque vista.",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“But how strange... It makes one feel rather forlorn at the same time.”",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“A bit of melancholy with the view makes the sake go down easier.”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hey, fill 'er up.”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, I s'pose I never did get a chance to drink with Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Soujin-sama was not one for drink, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Nah, he can handle it as well as anyone.”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Next time I see him, I'll pour one straight down his throat.”",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"Kazuma mutters, absently rocking his sake cup between two fingers.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's almost enough to make an atheist like me wanna go to church.”",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Empire sure is full of mysteries.”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Was it a mistake to think we could ever conquer this country?”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Acting so sentimental isn't like you at all.”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Maybe you just can't appreciate these things.”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			{
"Elsa holds out her hand, catching a petal that drifts in through the open window.",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What would Tokita-kun say right now, I wonder?”",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“'How beautiful,' with a totally deadpan expression on his face, I bet.”",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That was a pretty good impression, hehehee.”",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Oh my, is it snowing?”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			{
"Kotone catches a falling petal in her hand.",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Look at all these flower petals!”",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Could this be a miracle from Oomikami?”",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“(A miracle, huh?)”",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			{
"Kotone turns to gaze at the Imperial Tomb in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			{
"The snowfall of Persica does not abate, continuing to fall steadily over Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			{
"None in the jubilant city below know what their true nature is.",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			{
"And that is for the best.",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			{
"The Empress must not shed any tears.",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			{
"Hers is to cast aside her heart and live only for the sake of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			{
"The snow crunches beneath my feet as my blade rends apart the frigid air.",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			{
"I will cut them down.",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			{
"The tide of karmic distortions surging forward is never-ending, but I will cut them all down.",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"The enemy crashes upon me like a storm, but I meet them with a storm of my own.",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			{
